# Mojo-only architecture

```text
MOJO = linguagem do processo
```

Do not add Python to `agentd`. Do not introduce `src/interop/python` or `src/python`.

## Layers

| Layer | Path | Owns | Must not do |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Domain | `src/domain/` | types, rules, ports/traits | I/O, vendors |
| Application | `src/application/` | use cases, graph, agents, RAG flow | HTTP/JSON/gRPC |
| Bootstrap | `src/bootstrap/` | composition root | business rules |
| Transport | `src/transport/` | HTTP/gRPC adapters, router, endpoints, handlers | domain rules |
| Infrastructure | `src/infrastructure/` | sockets, env, local adapters, IPC, compute | domain rules |

`src/ai_orchestrator/` is leftover FastAPI (Strangler). Do not extend it.

vLLM / LiteLLM stay as external HTTP services. Training/HF serving stay out of this process.

## Placement rule

When adding a feature, state the layer and why. Implement it in Mojo.

```mojo
var tokenizer = Tokenizer()
var tokens = tokenizer.encode("Hello Mojo")
```
